    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A mentor? A soldier? They'd look at me and see the man who sent their brothers to die. They wouldn't offer advice, they'd offer their blades. There is no \"moving past\" this. Some mistakes aren't lessons, they're just... endings. I feel like I'm already a ghost, just waiting for my body to realize it. Like there's a debt that only one thing can settle.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
