    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But that's just more words, isn't it? To live is to keep walking through the blood, knowing it's my fault every single step. A \"brave son\" doesn't lead his people into a slaughterhouse. In these old stories, the only way a man like me finds peace is by making it right. To end the shame before it consumes me. Doesn't a broken oath deserve a final, clean end?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
